#% title
# min_machine_number

#% text
# `min_machine_number` is the smallest positive machine number of full precision, `2^-1022`.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# It is 2.2250738585072014e-308.

#% item
# Smaller positive numbers are subnormal and have fewer significant digits.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
min_machine_number
#% output
#= 2.2250738585072014e-308

#% cell
min_machine_number*machine_epsilon > 0.
#% output
#= true

#% cell
1/min_machine_number
#% output
